      <activity id="4d4b7937-da03-5b6a-8a5e-8b8aa54a959c" activityNameId="695e143c-7f53-5cdd-8260-bd93f9794336" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Portachrom, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Portachrom, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of milled chromite. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
CAS number: 053293-42-8; 
UUID: 08871817-72de-3828-b594-9c96b83aa938
Raw materials, machineries and energy consumption for production, estimated emissions to air from production and infrastructure of the site (approximation). No water emissions. Overburden and tailing material from process together with losses of product not taken into account.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Data approximated with data from iron mining, lime crushing and lime milling.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: approximation with data from literature 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_08871817-72de-3828-b594-9c96b83aa938.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
